=== exp3: epilogue remote write vs local write (sm90) ===
world 4, GEMM on GPU 0, remote peer GPU 1
GPU 0: NVIDIA H800  sm_90  132 SMs  1980 MHz
GPU 1: NVIDIA H800  sm_90  132 SMs  1980 MHz
GPU 2: NVIDIA H800  sm_90  132 SMs  1980 MHz
GPU 3: NVIDIA H800  sm_90  132 SMs  1980 MHz
[note] flux sm90 GEMM+RS deliberately does NOT remote-write in the epilogue
(it TMA-stores locally and pulls); its sm80 path does. This measures that choice.

